  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : $\\sqrt{3} \\sin x+\\cos x=2 \\sin \\left(x+\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right) \\leq 2$. Therefore\n$\\sqrt{3} \\sin x+\\cos x=4 \\quad$ cannot have a solution",
